er/Vagtrafik--och-hastighetsdata/fordonsfloden-och-hastigheter/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"På trafikflödeskartan och klickbara kartan finns information om fordonsflödet på statliga vägnätet. Där presenteras bland annat årsmedeldygnstrafik (ÅDT) för fordon, mc-flöden, cykel-flöden och hastighetsinformation. Här finns också mc-flöden som pdf."},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Fordonsflöden och hastigheter"}}],"@id":"urn:source:167921818b3d420e8fa94213ad8e5e84da583ae5024e70556aa1d7a9fff95959"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((11.11 69.06,24.16 69.06,24.16 55.34,11.11 55.34,11.11 69.06))"}},{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b10n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46(0)771921921"}},{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b1n0","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPlan":{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b1n3"}},{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b1n1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generated":{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b1n2"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAssociation":{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b1n0"}},{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b1n2","dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/DegreeOfConformity/conformant"}},{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce6976597c0f786647163ba2ced213721b61e2b346bea_b1n3","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2009/976/oj"}},{"@id":"_:169a82386bb633d4c8bce69