mation - Technical framework – Manual for  data product specification"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Tekniskt ramverk – Handbok för  dataproduktspecifikation"}]},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Teknisk rapport SIS-TR 14:2012"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Geographic information - Metadata in Swedish"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Metadata på svenska"}]},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/ss-en-iso-19157-12023/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"SS-EN ISO 19157-1"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Geographic information - Data quality – Part 1: General requirements"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Datakvalitet - Del 1: Allmäna krav"}]},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/ss-en-iso-191312022/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"SS-EN ISO 19131"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geographic Information - Data Product Specifications (Standard)"}},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/relevantastandarderfrgeodataenvgledning/Om19157/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handledning som stödjer den internationella standarden för geodatakvalitet SS-EN ISO 19157 Geografisk information – Datakvalitet"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handledning för datakvalitet"}},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om plattformar för att hämta data och instruktioner om hur man hämtar data"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Tillhandahållande av resurs"}},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/tjanster/trafiktjanster/Vagtrafik--och-hastighetsdata/f