nistration's service for downloading file-based geodata."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"WFS-tjänst för vägdata enligt INSPIRE-direktiv. För användning i applikationer. Används i tillämpningar internt och externt för att visa vägdata på karta. \n\nÖppna tjänsten genom att klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara."}],"dct:identifier":"a3e0b2ae-7869-4ece-8a18-5b27737ebd0e","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:gYear","@value":"2022"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:3fae9f9ce48eafe1b41d46f9b05e0d7462c458fbbb6c6549a0f08afc7ce95bf4_b15n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoProductAccessService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Road Transport Network - Download Service (INSPIRE)"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/contentassets/f4d7a64a5cb84b6f919d5e4645e868c7/tjanstebeskrivning_inspire_tn_giltig-version.pdf"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"84ce3866-7e61-4a30-9827-c51631ad0121","http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#identifier":"TN.RoadTransportNetwork.DownloadService","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":[{"@id":"_:3fae9f9ce48eafe1b41d46f9b05e0d7462c458fbbb6c6549a0f08afc7ce95bf4_b16n1"},{"@id":"_:3fae9f9ce48eafe1b41d46f9b05e0d7462c458fbbb6c6549a0f08afc7ce95bf4_b17n1"}],"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/road-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/road"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/249","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/464"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/512"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/556"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"INSPIRE"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=249&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/BIWEEKLY"},"dct:alternative":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"TN.Väg.Tillgänglighetsrestriktioner"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägnät - Tillgänglighetsrestriktioner (INSPIRE)"}],"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/4258"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2010-12-08"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"(införd 8/12-25):\nThe dataset provides legal access restriction to roads or parts of roads according to the INSPIRE Transport Network (TN) specification AccessRestriction. AccessRestriction is the result of processing the following road data products:\n-\tTraffic prohibited\n-\tTraffic prohibited, private road\n-\tProhibited direction of travel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängden redovisar juridisk grundad åtkomstrestriktion till vägar eller delar av vägar enligt Inspiretema transportnät (TN) AccessRestriction. AccessRestriction är resultatet av en bearbetning av följande vägdataprodukter:\n- Förbud mot trafik\n- Förbud mot trafik, enskild väg\n- Förbjuden färdriktning\n\nDatamängden går att komma åt via wms, wfs och nedladdning av förgenererade filer."}],"dct:identifier":"c503b3cc-dad4-472b-b61b-6f4d8595e3ba","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2010-12-08"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2016-03-23"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:3fae9f9ce48eafe1b41d46f9b05e0d7462c458fbbb6c6549a0f08afc7ce95bf4_b18n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:3fae9f9ce48eafe1b41d46f9b05e0d7462c458fbbb6c6549a0f08afc7ce95bf4_b19n0"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"}],"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:3fae9f9ce48eafe1b41d46f9b05e0d7462c458fbbb6c6549a0f08afc7ce95bf4_b20n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Road Transport Network - Access Restriction (INSPIRE)"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"http://www.nvdb.se"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/TrvSeFiler/Dataprodukt