:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"En applikation där det finns information om fordonsflödet på statliga vägnätet. Här presenteras bland annat årsmedeldygnstrafik (ÅDT) för fordon, mc-flöden, cykel-flöden och hastighetsinformation.\nObservera att det finns två flikar i kartan, flik TFK och flik TIKK."},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-19"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:4bcacf8a381bdc9656fa575207af3e40280f55b82f40c961b77b3d937dee6e2c_b24n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägtrafikflödeskartan (TIKK/TFK)"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/view"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"80e6bb4f-9d2e-416b-ad22-c57942520795","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:4bcacf8a381bdc9656fa575207af3e40280f55b82f40c961b77b3d937dee6e2c_b25n1"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/road-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/road"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/14","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Vägdata","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:nvdb@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:4bcacf8a381bdc9656fa575207af3e40280f55b82f40c961b77b3d937dee6e2c_b26n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/15","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Lastkajen","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:lastkajen@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:4bcacf8a381bdc9656fa575207af3e40280f55b82f40c961b77b3d937dee6e2c_b27n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Geografisk information","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:geografisk.information@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:4bcacf8a381bdc9656fa575207af3e40280f55b82f40c961b77b3d937dee6e2c_b28n0"}},{"@id":"https://www.nvdb.se/globalassets/upload/styrande-och-vagledande-dokument/nvdb---informationsmodell-v8.pdf","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationsdokument: NVDB informationsmodell"}},{"@id":"https://www.nvdb.se/sv/dokumentation/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dokument som är avsedda för dem som behöver veta mer om NVDB-systemet, vilka data som hanteras och hur de hanteras."},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: NVDB Dokumentation"}},{"@id":"https://www.nvdb.se/sv/om-nvdb/vart-kvalitetsarbete/nvdb-datavalideringar/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datakontroller som görs för fullständighet för brist och övertalighet samt sambandskontroller."},"dct:title":{"@language"