n.\nAccess the service by pasting the access address link into an appropriate software."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En karttjänst för järnvägsdata enligt INSPIRE-direktiv. För användning i applikationer.\n\nNedladdningstjänst på WFS-format. Öppna tjänsten genom att klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara."}],"dct:identifier":"973d3285-a42c-468e-92b7-1a976ed7f727","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:gYear","@value":"2022"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:6f7304fa56c223d31e5944b0c731de9b65cfa1a69f128196d39b749b267ec8d0_b5n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/thematicGoparameterCalculationService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Railway Transport Network - Download Service (INSPIRE)"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/contentassets/f4d7a64a5cb84b6f919d5e4645e868c7/tjanstebeskrivning_inspire_tn_giltig-version.pdf"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"858ad0a1-1a6f-45dc-a950-44d3a833eeb1","http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#identifier":"TN.RailwayTransportNetwork.DownloadService","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":[{"@id":"_:6f7304fa56c223d31e5944b0c731de9b65cfa1a69f128196d39b749b267ec8d0_b6n1"},{"@id":"_:6f7304fa56c223d31e5944b0c731de9b65cfa1a69f128196d39b749b267ec8d0_b7n1"}],"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/railway-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/railway"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/418","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/452"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/495"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/549"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"INSPIRE"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=418&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/BIWEEKLY"},"dct:alternative":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägnät - Antal spår (INSPIRE)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"TN.Järnväg.Antal_spår"}],"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/4258"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2010-12-08"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The dataset provides the number of tracks represented by each railway link according to the the INSPIRE Transport Network (TN) specification for NumberOfTracks. In The Swedish Transport Administration’s data, all tracks are represented by their own geometries, and the number of tracks is therefore always 1."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängden redovisar antal spår som representeras av varje järnvägslänk enligt Inspiretema transportnät (TN) NumberOfTracks. I Trafikverkets data representeras alla spår med egna geometrier, antal spår är därför alltid 1.\n\nDatamängden går att komma åt via wms, wfs och nedladdning av förgenererade filer."}],"dct:identifier":"035ca90e-e5e8-484e-b530-26112dc6a0a1","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:gYear","@value":"2011"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2016-06-07"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:6f7304fa56c223d31e5944b0c731de9b65cfa1a69f128196d39b749b267ec8d0_b8n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:6f7304fa56c223d31e5944b0c731de9b65cfa1a69f128196d39b749b267ec8d0_b9n0"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"}],"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:6f7304fa56c223d31e5944b0c731de9b65cfa1a69f128196d39b749b267ec8d0_b10n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Railway Transport Network -  Number of Tracks (INSPIRE)"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-d