g, klicka på länken under webbadress och logga in på Lastkajen (användarkonto krävs). Efter inloggning, klistra in samma länk i webbläsaren för direkt åtkomst.\""},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GPKG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"TN.RailwayTransportNetwork.VerticalPosition - download through Lastkajen"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/511","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/238"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"http://geo-inspire.trafikverket.se/MapService/wfs.axd/TN_RailTransportNetwork?service=WFS&version=2.0.0&request=GetFeature&typenames=VerticalPosition"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:OGC:WFS"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"OBS: För åtkomst/nedladdning, klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara. Välj sedan lagret som motsvarar datamängden."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WFS_SRVC"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"TN.RailwayTransportNetwork.VerticalPosition - download service"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/