ges en utbredning med koppling till järnvägsnätet samt en eller flera attributtyper. Dataprodukter knyts till järnvägsnätet för att de ska kunna behandlas på ett enhetligt sätt i förhållande till dels varandra, dels till själva järnvägsnätet."}},{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b7n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((11.11 69.06,24.16 69.06,24.16 55.34,11.11 55.34,11.11 69.06))"}},{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b8n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:endDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2099-12-31"},"dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2001-01-01"}},{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b9n0","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPlan":{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b9n3"}},{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b9n1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generated":{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b9n2"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAssociation":{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b9n0"}},{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b9n2","dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/DegreeOfConformity/conformant"}},{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b9n3","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089/oj"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021006297","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:datasetsadmin@trafikverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/9/resource/1851"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/178"}]},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"SS-EN ISO 19115–1"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Geographic information - Metadata –  Part 1: Fundamentals"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Metadata –  Del 1: Grunder"}]},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"SIS-TS 80:2018"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Nationell metadataprofil för geografisk information (Standard)"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beskrivning av tjänster för nedladdning och geodatatjänster"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Använda data"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ingångssida för information om vägar, järnvägar och trafik"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Data, kartor och geodatatjänster"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om Trafikverkets dataprodukter"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Läs om våra data"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/jarnvagsdata/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida med dataprodukter inom järnväg"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Läs om våra järnvägsdata"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1097","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/orderdata/jvg"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Nedladdning"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängd gällande Fysisk hinderfri längd. Filerna finns i geopackage-format. Extern eller intern maskinell filnedladdning kan göras via API-datatjänst. \n\nOBS: För åtkomst/nedladdning, klicka på länken under webbadress och logga in på Lastkajen (användarkonto krävs). Efter inloggning, klistra in samma länk i webbläsaren för direkt åtkomst."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GPKG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägsdata Fysisk hinderfri längd - nedladdning i Lastkajen"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1162","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/960"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"http://geo-baninfo.trafikverket.se/MapService/wms.axd/BanInfo_1_5?layers=Fysisk_hinderfri_langd"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:OGC:WMS"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"OBS: För åtkomst/visning, klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara. Välj sedan lagret som motsvarar datamängden."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WMS_SRVC"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägsdata Fysisk hinderfri längd - visning"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1343","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/958"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://njdbwebb.trafikverket.se/SeTransportnatverket"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Information"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visning av datat med denna egenskap i NJDB på webb.\n\nOBS: För åtkomst/visning, klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i webbläsaren. Välj sedan egenskapen som motsvarar datamängden."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägsdata Fysisk hinderfri längd - visning i NJDB på webb"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/15"},"dcat:endpointURL":[{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/"},{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"en","@value":"download service"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"nedladdningstjänst"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=186&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/HEAL"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:alternative":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lastkajen"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Nedladdning:API"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2015-03-17"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Web application to order and download road and railway data from The Swedish Transport Administration’s (Trafikverket) databases. You will find data for road networks and other products for all Swedish municipalities and regions.\n\nAn API service for downloading road and railway data (https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi) is also available.\n To access/download, follow the link and log in to Lastkajen (a free user account is required). After logging in, paste the same URL again in your browser for direct access."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Webbaserad applikation som gör det möjligt för dig att beställa och hämta väg- och järnvägsdata från Trafikverkets databaser. Här ligger alla Sveriges kommuner och län färdiga med vägnät och dataprodukter.\n\nApplikationen innehåller också en API-tjänst för nedladdning av väg- och järnvägsdata (https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi). För åtkomst/nedladdning, klicka på länken under åtkomstaddress och logga in på Lastkajen (användarkonto krävs). Efter inloggning, klistra in samma länk i webbläsaren för direkt åtkomst."}],"dct:identifier":"f358d6f2-76fe-4969-9c02-56c175e345ce","dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-01"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:960f7dbfcbc27d623714459aad2248e485d972b31c87dfa0863e24fd64d2fd95_b0n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/comTransferService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoOrderHandlingService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoProductAccessService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lastkajen - Nedladdningstjänst"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tj