resslänken i webbläsaren. Välj sedan egenskapen som motsvarar datamängden."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägsdata Lutning - visning i NJDB på webb"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/15"},"dcat:endpointURL":[{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/"},{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"en","@value":"download service"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"nedladdningstjänst"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=186&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/HEAL"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:alternative":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lastkajen"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Nedladdning:API"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2015-03-17"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Web application to order and download road and railway data from The Swedish Transport Administration’s (Trafikverket) databases. You will find data for road networks and other products for all Swedish municipalities and regions.\n\nAn API service for downloading road and railway data (https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi) is also available.\n To access/download, follow the link and log in to Lastkajen (a free user account is required). After logging in, paste the same URL again in your browser for direct access."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Webbaserad applikation som gör det möjligt för dig att beställa och hämta väg- och järnvägsdata från Trafikverkets databaser. Här ligger alla Sveriges kommuner och län färdiga med vägnät och dataprodukter.\n\nApplikationen innehåller också en API-tjänst för nedladdning av väg- och järnvägsdata (https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi). För åtkomst/nedladdning, klicka på länken under åtkomstaddress och logga in på Lastkajen (användarkonto krävs). Efter inloggning, klistra in samma länk i webbläsaren för direkt åtkomst."}],"dct:identifier":"f358d6f2-76fe-4969-9c02-56c175e345ce","dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-01"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b4n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/comTransferService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoOrderHandlingService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoProductAccessService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lastkajen - Nedladdningstjänst"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/lastkajen"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":[{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_e1da4e07"}],"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"f9489872-7415-4c6b-a46a-7929235d4983","http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#identifier":"Lastkajen.DownloadService","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b5n1"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/railway-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/road-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/cross-modal"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/railway"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/road"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/958","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16"},"dcat:endpointURL":{"@id":"https://njdbwebb.trafikverket.se/"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"view service"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"visningstjänst"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=958&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:OGC:API-Maps"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2016-12-16"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tittskåpstjänst där man kan titta på och göra filtreringar av järnvägsdata."},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-19"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b6n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"NJDB på webb"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/view"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"a4430f27-339d-4abc-b29d-4d2b2e46f7dc","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b7n1"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/railway-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/railway"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/960","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16"},"dcat:endpointURL":{"@id":"http://geo-baninfo.trafikverket.se/mapservice/wms.axd/BanInfo_1_5"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"view service"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"visningstjänst"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=960&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:alternative":{"@language":"en","@value":"Railway Data - View Service"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:OGC:WMS"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2013-04-22"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The view service displays a selection of the Trafikverket, Swedish Transport Administration’s railway track data. The dataset on track data includes NJDB, the Swedish National Railway Database, in which data for railway facilities owned and managed by an actor other than the state and Trafikverket is collected."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En visningstjänst som innehåller ett urval av Trafikverkets Bandata. Tjänsten används bl.a. av NJDB på webb, Stigfinnaren och JaK.\nDetta är en tjänst som innehåller öppna data och publiceras externt.\n\nÖppna tjänsten genom att klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara (ex. ArcGIS)."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-05-07"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b8n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visningstjänst för järnvägsdata - BanInfo"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/view"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"3d5bfbbe-de59-4a91-b01e-0c9f11219fb6","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b9n1"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/railway-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/railway"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/12","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Järnvägsdata","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:njdb@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b10n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/15","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Lastkajen","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:lastkajen@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b11n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Geografisk information","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:geografisk.information@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707_b12n0"}},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Teknisk rapport SIS-TR 14:2012"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Geographic information - Metadata in Swedish"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Metadata på svenska"}]},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om plattformar för att hämta data och instruktioner om hur man hämtar data"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Tillhandahållande av resurs"}}],"@id":"urn:source:a3b30a70067de6d06557fae6942a7d57a28797f2cc7917a6100b3d66b6158707"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dataprodukten ajourhålls genom en bearbetning av ett antal redan existerande dataprodukter.\n\nDe dataprodukter som ligger till grund för rubricerad dataprodukt ajourhålls i NVDB teknisk lösning. NVDB teknisk lösning är det system där såväl referensnät för väg som nationella och statliga dataprodukter kopplade till referensnätet ajourhålls. Den nationella vägdatabasen (NVDB) omfattas av denna hantering.\n\nDetta gäller för alla dataprodukter som används vid bearbetningen utom länsindelningen som hämtas från Lantmäteriet."}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((11.11 69.06,24.16 69.06,24.16 55.34,11.11 55.34,11.11 69.06))"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b2n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:endDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2099-12-31"},"dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2001-01-01"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b3n0","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPlan":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b3n3"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b3n1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generated":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b3n2"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAssociation":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b3n0"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b3n2","dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/DegreeOfConformity/conformant"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b3n3","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089/oj"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b4n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((11.11 69.06,24.16 69.06,24.16 55.34,11.11 55.34,11.11 69.06))"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b5n0","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPlan":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b5n3"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b5n1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generated":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b5n2"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAssociation":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b5n0"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b5n2","dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/DegreeOfConformity/conformant"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b5n3","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2009/976/oj"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b6n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46(0)771921921"}},{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b7n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46(0)771921921"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021006297","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:datasetsadmin@trafikverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/9/resource/1851"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/178"}]},{"@id":"http://www.nvdb.se","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nationell vägdatabas för dataanvändare och dataleverantörer (Trafikverket, Sveriges kommuner, skogsnäringen, Transportstyrelsen, Lantmäteriet)."},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: NVDB - nationell vägdatabas"}},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"SS-EN ISO 19115–1"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Geographic information - Metadata –  Part 1: Fundamentals"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Metadata –  Del 1: Grunder"}]},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"SIS-TS 80:2018"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Nationell metadataprofil för geografisk information (Standard)"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beskrivning av tjänster för nedladdning och geodatatjänster"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Använda data"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/dataproduktspecifikationer-vag","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida med presentation av dataprodukspecifikationer."},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Dataproduktspecifikationer för väg- och vägtrafikdata"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ingångssida för information om vägar, järnvägar och trafik"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Data, kartor och geodatatjänster"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om Trafikverkets dataprodukter"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Läs om våra data"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/omgivande-geodataoch-kombinerade-vag-jarnvagsdataprodukter/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om de dataprodukter som varken kan kopplas direkt till väg eller järnväg, så kallade omgivande geodata, eller är dataprodukter skapade som en kombination av både väg- och järnväg."},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Omgivande geodata och kombinerade väg-järnvägsdataprodukter"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1027","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/14"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1165"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Data packages and special products"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datapaket och specialprodukter"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=1027&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/IRREG"},"dct:alternative":{"@language":"en","@value":"Road Data for Route Planning"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2016-01-01"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägdata för transportplanering är en förädlad dataprodukt som genereras utifrån ett antal företeelsetyper (grunddataprodukter).\n\nProdukten skapas genom att ett antal för ruttning intressanta egenskaper från de olika grunddataprodukterna ärvs ner till ett gemensamt nät av länkar genom en process kallad homogenisering. Homogeniserat data innebär att ingående företeelsetypernas attribut gäller över ett helt segment (länk). Där attribut förändras avslutas länken och ett nytt segment börjar. Vilka attribut en användare behöver beror på för vilken typ av fordon och till vilket syfte ruttningen eller transportplanering ska göras.\n\nVägdata för transportplanering kan upplevas väldigt omfattande då produkten innehåller data som ska kunna användas för alla typer av fordon som attributen har insamlat."},"dct:identifier":"5208e5b6-6023-4b63-8e2d-825624bf5b05","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2016-01-01"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-11-12"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b1n0"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"}],"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b2n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägdata för transportplanering"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"http://www.nvdb.se"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/dataproduktspecifikationer-vag"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/omgivande-geodataoch-kombinerade-vag-jarnvagsdataprodukter/"},{"@id":"https://www.nvdb.se/globalassets/upload/styrande-och-vagledande-dokument/nvdb---informationsmodell-v8.pdf"},{"@id":"https://www.nvdb.se/sv/dokumentation/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"eb1f470a-32cb-4d56-9e5c-597804be6492","http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/ProgressCode/onGoing"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b3n1"},"https://dataportal.se/concepts/geose/areaCoveredQuotient":"449964/449964","https://dataportal.se/concepts/geose/spatialScope":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialScope/national"},"https://dataportal.se/concepts/geose/useLimitation":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ingen begränsning"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/DataPackagesAndSpecialProducts"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/road-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/road"}],"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/schema/confidentiality":"1"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1165","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/productpackages/10084"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Nedladdning"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängd gällande Vägdata för transportplanering. Dataprodukten finns i det färdiga paketet: Vägdata för transportplanering. Filerna finns i geopackage-format. Extern eller intern maskinell filnedladdning kan göras via API-datatjänst.\n\nOBS: För åtkomst/nedladdning, klicka på länken under webbadress och logga in på Lastkajen (användarkonto krävs). Efter inloggning, klistra in samma länk i webbläsaren för direkt åtkomst."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GPKG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägdata för transportplanering - nedladdning i Lastkajen/Vägdata för transportplanering"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/15"},"dcat:endpointURL":[{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/"},{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"en","@value":"download service"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"nedladdningstjänst"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=186&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/HEAL"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:alternative":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lastkajen"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Nedladdning:API"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2015-03-17"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Web application to order and download road and railway data from The Swedish Transport Administration’s (Trafikverket) databases. You will find data for road networks and other products for all Swedish municipalities and regions.\n\nAn API service for downloading road and railway data (https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi) is also available.\n To access/download, follow the link and log in to Lastkajen (a free user account is required). After logging in, paste the same URL again in your browser for direct access."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Webbaserad applikation som gör det möjligt för dig att beställa och hämta väg- och järnvägsdata från Trafikverkets databaser. Här ligger alla Sveriges kommuner och län färdiga med vägnät och dataprodukter.\n\nApplikationen innehåller också en API-tjänst för nedladdning av väg- och järnvägsdata (https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi). För åtkomst/nedladdning, klicka på länken under åtkomstaddress och logga in på Lastkajen (användarkonto krävs). Efter inloggning, klistra in samma länk i webbläsaren för direkt åtkomst."}],"dct:identifier":"f358d6f2-76fe-4969-9c02-56c175e345ce","dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-01"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b4n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/comTransferService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoOrderHandlingService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoProductAccessService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lastkajen - Nedladdningstjänst"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/lastkajen"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":[{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_e1da4e07"}],"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"f9489872-7415-4c6b-a46a-7929235d4983","http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#identifier":"Lastkajen.DownloadService","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b5n1"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/railway-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/road-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/cross-modal"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/railway"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/road"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/14","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Vägdata","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:nvdb@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b6n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/15","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Lastkajen","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:lastkajen@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f_b7n0"}},{"@id":"https://www.nvdb.se/globalassets/upload/styrande-och-vagledande-dokument/nvdb---informationsmodell-v8.pdf","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationsdokument: NVDB informationsmodell"}},{"@id":"https://www.nvdb.se/sv/dokumentation/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dokument som är avsedda för dem som behöver veta mer om NVDB-systemet, vilka data som hanteras och hur de hanteras."},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: NVDB Dokumentation"}},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Teknisk rapport SIS-TR 14:2012"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Geographic information - Metadata in Swedish"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Metadata på svenska"}]},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om plattformar för att hämta data och instruktioner om hur man hämtar data"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Tillhandahållande av resurs"}}],"@id":"urn:source:a44368876e8560931c2661067d1dba7ab6478053f4cc15da45f4f79b15ed297f"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a484d54a079bc95dc43a3fce4bc9a1f7c187bd13f238e6fbcf43558a15e4a237_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"NVDB innehåller ett nationellt gemensamt vägnät med data om länkar och noder samt en uppsättning grundläggande vägdata. NVDB:s vägnät kan användas som ett långsiktigt stabilt nationellt referenssystem för koppling av olika slags uppgifter till vägar. NVDB:s vägnät omfattar statliga, kommunala och enskilda vägar. Datainsamling sker i samverkan mellan Sveriges kommuner, Skogsnäringen, Trafikverket och Lantmäteriet."}},{"@id":"_:a484d54a079bc95dc43a3fce4bc9a1f7c187bd13f238e6fbcf43558a15e4a237_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((11.11 69.06,24.16 69.06,24.16 55.34,11.11 55.34,11.11 69.06))"}},{"@id":"_:a484d54a079bc95dc43a3fce4