mation om fordonsflödet på statliga vägnätet. Här presenteras bland annat årsmedeldygnstrafik (ÅDT) för fordon, mc-flöden, cykel-flöden och hastighetsinformation.\nObservera att det finns två flikar i kartan, flik TFK och flik TIKK."},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-19"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:afccbf9f8decd00b5f2ba8e85bd294e937e2083f7a1f7fb15daf6fec7806961e_b24n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägtrafikflödeskartan (TIKK/TFK)"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/view"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"80e6bb4f-9d2e-416b-ad22-c57942520795","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:afccbf9f8decd00b5f2ba8e85bd294e937e2083f7a1f7fb15daf6fec7806961e_b25n1"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/road-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/road"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/14","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Orga