atatjänster"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om Trafikverkets dataprodukter"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Läs om våra data"}},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/jarnvagsdata/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida med dataprodukter inom järnväg"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Läs om våra järnvägsdata"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1039","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/12"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1120"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1193"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1376"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"StJDB"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"StJDB"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=1039&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:alternative":{"@language":"en","@value":"Railway Data - Signalling Board ERTMS"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2012-05-15"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Signalpunktstavla ERTMS är en viktig komponent i säkerhetssystemet ERTMS. Den motsvarar signalläge i konventionellt system dvs. en punkt i spåret som inte får passeras utan körtillstånd.\n\nVarje driftplats efter järnvägen omges av ett antal informationspunkter som markerar signallägen för in- och utfart till driftplatsen och där körtillstånd krävs för passage. För positioner ute på spårnätet finns linjetavlor och mellantavlor. En Balisgrupp ERTMS är oftast placerad i omedelbar anslutning till Signalpunktstavla ERTMS.\n\nDe viktigaste objektattributen för Signalpunktstavla ERTMS är följande:\n- Typ av IP (Infopunkt): Infartstavla, utfartstavla, mellantavla eller linjetavla.\n- Riktningsgiltighet: I vilken riktning signalen gäller\n- Platssignatur: Till vilken plats tavlan är kopplad. (Senast passerad driftplats för Linjetavlor och Mellantavlor).\n- Nummer: Signalpunktens nummer (unikt)\n\nDataprodukten har punktutbredning och kopplar till järnvägsnätet med referens mot närmast föregående nod och närmast föregående kilometertavla med avstånd i meter i spårlänkens riktning."},"dct:identifier":"471fefd8-a05e-4b68-930c-19b2a9b49eec","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2012-05-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-11-12"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:c30024c8727461f8987e3140bda9c81bddeafc6681780ac9ba058acfa2f49499_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:c30024c8727461f8987e3140bda9c81bddeafc6681780ac9ba058acfa2f49499_b1n0"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"}],"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:c30024c8727461f8987e3140bda9c81bddeafc6681780ac9ba058acfa2f49499_b2n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägsdata - Signalpunktstavla ERTMS"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/las-om-vara-data/jarnvagsdata/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/958"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/960"}],"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"033f4192-d5d9-480d-9e64-5a811f65df80","http://schema.org/image":{"@id":"http://geo-baninfo.trafikverket.se/MapService/wms.axd/BanInfo_1_5?SERVICE=WMS&VERSION=1.3.0&REQUEST=GetMap&layers=Signalpunktstavla_ERTMS&STYLES=&SRS=EPSG:3006&BBOX=6988469,630465,6995351,637395&WIDTH=620&HEIGHT=620&FORMAT=image/png&"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/ProgressCode/onGoing"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:c30024c8727461f8987e3140bda9c81bddeafc6681780ac9ba058acfa2f49499_b3n1"},"https://dataportal.se/concepts/geose/areaCoveredQuotient":"449964/449964","https://dataportal.se/concepts/geose/spatialScope":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialScope/national"},"https://dataportal.se/concepts/geose/useLimitation":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ingen begränsning"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/RW_StateRailwayNetworkDataStJDB"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/StJDB_PhysicalObjects"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/railway-data"}],"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/schema/confidentiality":"1"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1120","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/orderdata/jvg"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Nedladdning"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängd gällande Signalpunktstavla ERTMS. Filerna finns i geopackage-format. Extern eller intern maskinell filnedladdning kan göras via API-datatjänst. \n\nOBS: För åtkomst/nedladdning, klicka på länken under webbadress och logga in på Lastkajen (användarkonto krävs). Efter inloggning, klistra in samma länk i webbläsaren för direkt åtkomst."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GPKG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägsdata Signalpunktstavla ERTMS - nedladdning i Lastkajen"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1193","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/960"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"http://geo-baninfo.trafikverket.se/MapService/wms.axd/BanInfo_1_5?layers=Signalpunktstavla_ERTMS"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:OGC:WMS"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"OBS: För åtkomst/visning, klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara. Välj sedan lagret som motsvarar datamängden."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WMS_SRVC"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägsdata Signalpunktstavla ERTMS - visning"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/1376","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/958"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://njdbwebb.trafikverket.se/SeTransportnatverket"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Information"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visning av datat med denna egenskap i NJDB på webb.\n\nOBS: För åtkomst/visning, klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i webbläsaren. Välj sedan egenskapen som motsvarar datamängden."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Järnvägsdata Signalpunktstavla ERTMS - visning i NJDB på webb"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialRepresentationTypeCode/vector"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/186","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/15"},"dcat:endpointURL":[{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/"},{"@id":"https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"en","@value":"download service"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"nedladdningstjänst"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=186&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/HEAL"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:alternative":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lastkajen"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/metadata/protokoll.xml#HTTP:Nedladdning:API"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2015-03-17"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Web application to order and download road and railway data from The Swedish Transport Administration’s (Trafikverket) databases. You will find data for road networks and other products for all Swedish municipalities and regions.\n\nAn API service for downloading road and railway data (https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi) is also available.\n To access/download, follow the link and log in to Lastkajen (a free user account is required). After logging in, paste the same URL again in your browser for direct access."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Webbaserad applikation som gör det möjligt för dig att beställa och hämta väg- och järnvägsdata från Trafikverkets databaser. Här ligger alla Sveriges kommuner och län färdiga med vägnät och dataprodukter.\n\nApplikationen innehåller också en API-tjänst för nedladdning av väg- och järnvägsdata (https://lastkajen.trafikverket.se/aboutapi). För åtkomst/nedladdning, klicka på länken under åtkomstaddress och logga in på Lastkajen (användarkonto krävs). Efter inloggning, klistra in samma länk i webbläsaren för direkt åtkomst."}],"dct:identifier":"f358d6f2-76fe-4969-9c02-56c175e345ce","dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-01"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:c30024c8727461f8987e3140bda9c81bddeafc6681780ac9ba058acfa2f49499_b4n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/comTransferService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoOrderHandlingService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoProductAccessService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lastkajen - Nedladdningstjänst"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/lastkajen"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":[{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_e1da4e07"}],"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"f9489872-7415-4c6b-a46a-7929235d4983","http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#identifier":"Lastkajen.DownloadService","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:c30024c8727461f8987e3140bda9c81bddeafc6681780ac9ba058acfa2f49499_b5n1"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/railway-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/road-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/cross-modal"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/railway"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/road"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/958","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16"},"dcat:endpointURL":{"@id":"https://njdbwebb.trafikverket.se/"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"view service"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"visningstjänst"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=958&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/s