National Railway Database, in which data for railway facilities owned and managed by an actor other than the state and Trafikverket is collected."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En visningstjänst som innehåller ett urval av Trafikverkets Bandata. Tjänsten används bl.a. av NJDB på webb, Stigfinnaren och JaK.\nDetta är en tjänst som innehåller öppna data och publiceras externt.\n\nÖppna tjänsten genom att klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara (ex. ArcGIS)."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-05-07"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:d63d6a9d858a0ee0fe164c62a42421f0787b7708c5c73d2e59c605c99de4b851_b8n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visningstjänst för järnvägsdata - BanInfo"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/view"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"3d5bfbbe-de59-4a91-b01e-0c9f11219fb6","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":{"@id":"_:d63d6a9d858a0ee0fe164c62a42421f0787b7708c5c73d2e59c605c99de4b851_b9n1"},"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/railway-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/railway"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/12","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Järnvägsdata","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:njdb@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:d63d6a9d858a0ee0fe164c62a42421f0787b7708c5c73d2e59c605c99de4b851_b10n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/15","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Lastkajen","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:lastkajen@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:d63d6a9d858a0ee0fe164c62a42421f0787b7708c5c73d2e59c605c99de4b851_b11n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikverket - Geografisk information","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:geografisk.information@trafikverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:d63d6a9d858a0ee0fe164c62a42421f0787b7708c5c73d2e59c605c99de4b851_b12n0"}},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Teknisk rapport SIS-TR 14:2012"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Geographic information - Metadata in Swedish"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information - Metadata på svenska"}]},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om plattformar för att hämta data och instruktioner om hur man hämtar data"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationssida: Tillhandahållande av resurs"}}],"@id":"urn:source:d63d6a9d858a0ee0fe164c62a42421f0787b7708c5c73d2e59c605c99de4b851"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dataprodukter för järnväg beskrivs genom att de ges en utbredning med koppling till järnvägsnätet samt en eller flera attributtyper. Dataprodukter knyts till järnvägsnätet för att de ska kunna behandlas på ett enhetligt sätt i förhållande till dels varandra, dels till själva järnvägsnätet.\n\n\nDataprodukten ingår i NJDB – nationell järnvägsdatabas."}},{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b10n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46(0)771921921"}},{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b11n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46(0)771921921"}},{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b12n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46(0)771921921"}},{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((11.11 69.06,24.16 69.06,24.16 55.34,11.11 55.34,11.11 69.06))"}},{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b2n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:endDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2099-12-31"},"dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2001-01-01"}},{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b3n0","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPlan":{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b3n3"}},{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08d3fdf817c2e8d_b3n1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generated":{"@id":"_:d6728ac7a779ba054ba801a4cc41fc0a620312c3889b9b1aa08