ration’s (Trafikverket), according to the INSPIRE Transport Network (TN) specification for WaterwayNode and FerryCrossing. It is generated from the following road data products:\n•\tFerry Route / Färjeled"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"WFS-tjänst för färjeleder enligt INSPIRE-direktiv. För användning i applikationer. \n\nÖppna tjänsten genom att klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara."}],"dct:identifier":"cfcbc4af-41ec-45eb-ba53-b5f237f79060","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:gYear","@value":"2022"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:dcc89a24933562d807f11f6c689c251b9c33036b82cabbe748ed53165316ee3d_b3n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoProductAccessService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Water Transport Network - Download Service (INSPIRE)"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/contentassets/f4d7a64a5cb84b6f919d5e4645e868c7/tjanstebeskrivning_inspire_tn_giltig-version.pdf"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/