for  downloaded as pre-generated GeoPackage files via Lastkajen - the Swedish Transport Administration's service for downloading file-based geodata."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"WFS-tjänst för vägdata enligt INSPIRE-direktiv. För användning i applikationer. Används i tillämpningar internt och externt för att visa vägdata på karta. \n\nÖppna tjänsten genom att klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara."}],"dct:identifier":"a3e0b2ae-7869-4ece-8a18-5b27737ebd0e","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:gYear","@value":"2022"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:f0089c2620f9f520c69f2f8c4a7e13ec37721df46bf15c30663b5b5ef8190b04_b15n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoProductAccessService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Road Transport Network - Download Service (INSPIRE)"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/contentassets/f4d7a64a5cb84b6f919d5e4645e868c7/tjanstebeskrivning_inspire_tn_giltig-version.pdf"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb"},"http://entryscape.org/terms/metadataIdentifier":"84ce3866-7e61-4a30-9827-c51631ad0121","http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#identifier":"TN.RoadTransportNetwork.DownloadService","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasUsedBy":[{"@id":"_:f0089c2620f9f520c69f2f8c4a7e13ec37721df46bf15c30663b5b5ef8190b04_b16n1"},{"@id":"_:f0089c2620f9f520c69f2f8c4a7e13ec37721df46bf15c30663b5b5ef8190b04_b17n1"}],"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/ns/keyword":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/DataProductCategory/road-data"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/concepts/TransportMode/road"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/277","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/4/resource/16"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/472"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/521"},{"@id":"https://metadata.trafikverket.se/store/1/resource/565"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"INSPIRE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"INSPIRE"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.trafikverket.se/search/search-data/details?esc_entry=277&esc_context=1"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/tn"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/BIWEEKLY"},"dct:alternative":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"TN.Väg.Referenslänkdel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägnät - Referenslänkdel (INSPIRE)"}],"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3006"},{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/4258"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/foretagsorganisation/kvalitet/allmant/sseniso191152005/"},{"@id":"http://www.sis.se/produkter/informationsteknik-kontorsutrustning/ittillampningar/it-tillampningar-inom-vetenskap/sis-ts-802018/"},{"@id":"https://www.sis.se/api/document/get/86342"}],"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The dataset provides links of roads according to the INSPIRE Transport Network (TN) specification for RoadLink. \n\n It is generated from the following road data product:\nLink (preciously called Reference link part / Referenslänksdel)\n\nThe Link, which belongs to linksequence, specifies the validity period for a section of the linksequence. It is used to describe which section of a specific Linksequence are valid at different times. See also ”Linksequence” eller  Road Link sequence (INSPIRE)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängden redovisar väglänkar enligt Inspiretema transportnät (TN) RoadLink. \nRoadLink är genererad ur från följande vägdataprodukter: Link (f.d. Referenslänksdel) \n\nEn Link är kopplad till en LinkSequence (en LinkSequence representerar en vägsträcka som öppnats för trafik vid ett och samma tillfälle) och anger giltighetsperioden för en del av en LinkSequence. Link beskriver alltså vilka delar av en specifik LinkSequence som är giltiga vid olika tidpunkter. Se även ”Linksequence” eller  Road Link sequence (INSPIRE)"}],"dct:identifier":"667e7a9d-d1de-41dc-96b9-85bf9a12a3d0","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2010-12-08"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-06-05"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:f0089c2620f9f520c69f2f8c4a7e13ec37721df46bf15c30663b5b5ef8190b04_b18n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:f0089c2620f9f520c69f2f8c4a7e13ec37721df46bf15c30663b5b5ef8190b04_b19n0"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"}],"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dc