mpliant download service for road transport network datasets from the Swedish Transport Administration. \nAll INSPRE datasets from the Swedish Transport Administration are  also available for  downloaded as pre-generated GeoPackage files via Lastkajen - the Swedish Transport Administration's service for downloading file-based geodata."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"WFS-tjänst för vägdata enligt INSPIRE-direktiv. För användning i applikationer. Används i tillämpningar internt och externt för att visa vägdata på karta. \n\nÖppna tjänsten genom att klistra in åtkomstadresslänken i lämplig programvara."}],"dct:identifier":"a3e0b2ae-7869-4ece-8a18-5b27737ebd0e","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:gYear","@value":"2022"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006297"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:fc6c7f835268a534480e8f0b26d515736bc9b88c1bd18ff77c68fbbc137ebede_b35n0"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/humanGeographicViewer"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceCategory/infoProductAccessService"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/transportation"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8641"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Road Transport Network - Download Service (INSPIRE)"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/SpatialDataServiceType/download"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/anvandadata"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/contentassets/f4d7a64a5cb84b6f919d5e4645e868c7/tjanstebeskrivning_inspire_tn_giltig-version.pdf"},{"@id":"https://bransch.trafikverket.se/tjanster/data-kartor-och-geodatatjanster/"},{"@id":"https://www.trafikverket.se/e-tjanster/hamta-data-fran-trafikverket/"}],"http://data.europa